     mechanism) — not treated as a gap, per attempt-1's precedent.
2. Live keyboard update, BOTH directions, BOTH themes:
   - In-card sliders: ArrowRight on all 14 in-card converted sliders (full
     walk, both themes) updated .value, aria-valuetext, AND the visible
     display span in lockstep every time (e.g. portfolio
     "$2,500,000"->"$2,550,000" matching aria-valuetext and display
     exactly; healthcare "$1,655"->"1,700"; phase "93%"->"100%").
   - QA-drawer mirrors, ONE TAB AT A TIME (switching tabs first, since a
     hidden-tab control cannot receive focus in a real browser — confirmed
