     control in an inactive tab): ArrowRight+Home+End+PageUp on every QA
     mirror across all 4 tabs (portfolio, rates, phases incl. the 3
     id-less phase mirrors located by DOM index, healthcare x2 persons) —
     final aria-valuetext == final displayed text in every case, both
     themes (0 mismatches, `qa-tax-deferred-delay` correctly excluded, not
     WS1-scope).
   - Compound investment-return text, BOTH branches, BOTH directions:
     started "Fixed 6.3% (overrides allocation)" (card+QA avt+display all
     equal); Home on the in-card slider -> "Using asset allocation (~6.2%
     expected)" on all four locations; End on the QA mirror ->
     "Fixed 15.0% (overrides allocation)" on all four again. Screen-reader
     text for this control is correct in every state.
3. Restored Quick Adjust behaviours (C5 R1-R3), isolated fresh-fixture
